<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 20.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 20.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by Eesti Raadio on Tuesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Parliament approved the law on child support, which will increase the support sum for families with two or more children.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
